rectangle "nyx\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4>> {
  rectangle "nyx-ems\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4LWVtcw==>> {
    rectangle "==Physics adapter\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe Physics implementation of ems: descriptors, validation, solve entry." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxems.Physicsadapter
    rectangle "==Typed problem\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe typed ems problem the kernels read, decoded from the envelope." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxems.Typedproblem
    rectangle "==Mode kernel\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nFull-vector mode analysis of a 2D waveguide cross-section (inhomogeneous media allowed)." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxems.Modekernel
    rectangle "==Complex-mode kernel\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nComplex-valued mode analysis: lossy media and perfectly matched layers." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxems.Complexmodekernel
    rectangle "==Axisymmetric kernel\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nElectromagnetic eigenmodes of a body of revolution (rings, disks, coaxial cavities)." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxems.Axisymmetrickernel
    rectangle "==3D cavity kernel\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nElectromagnetic eigenmodes of 3D cavities and resonators, with superconducting thin-film IBC, lumped Josephson junctions, and physical H/K export." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxems.3Dcavitykernel
    rectangle "==Thin-film IBC and Josephson ROM\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nSuperconducting thin-film surface impedance boundary condition (Leontovich/two-fluid), rank-1 lumped Josephson port contribution, passive CircuitRom, and TLS metadata." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxems.ThinfilmIBCandJosephsonROM
    rectangle "==Driven frequency-domain and PROM\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nDriven 3D frequency-domain curl-curl solver with lumped/waveport excitations and Hermite Tangential Galerkin PROM sweep acceleration." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxems.DrivenfrequencydomainandPROM
    rectangle "==Optical mode sets\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe mode solvers' results as an OpticalSet, with the material data needed to evaluate their fields." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxems.Opticalmodesets
  }

  component "==nyx-physics\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe Physics trait, the problem envelope (ProblemSpec), descriptors, SolveResult, the registry type, validation, JSON Schemas." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.nyxphysics
  component "==femcore\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe FEM core: meshes, meshing and adaptation, linear algebra behind one driver, finite-element basics, the material specification and library, expressions." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.femcore
}

